              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and shield. May have heavy armour (+1). May ride a horse (+8) in which case the shield is discarded. Army General. Veteran.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
