            <rule id="f16b-8927-abfb-fec0" name="Dismount" hidden="false">
              <description>Lydian cavalry were capable of fighting dismounted and so may dismount for (–11) If dismounted they are Stubborn and Riding Horses with M4 and normal rank bonus.</description>
